# Sequence Diagram - Employee Management

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant HR as HR User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant API as Spring Boot API
    participant Service as EmployeService
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Note over HR,DB: Employee CRUD Operations

    %% Create Employee
    HR->>Frontend: Fill employee form
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/employes
    API->>Service: createEmploye(employeDto)
    Service->>DB: INSERT new employee
    DB-->>Service: Return saved employee
    Service-->>API: Return employee data
    API-->>Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend-->>HR: Show success notification

    %% Read Employees
    HR->>Frontend: View employee list
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/employes
    API->>Service: getAllEmployes()
    Service->>DB: SELECT all employees
    DB-->>Service: Return employee list
    Service-->>API: Return employee list
    API-->>Frontend: Return employee data
    Frontend-->>HR: Display employee table

    %% Update Employee
    HR->>Frontend: Edit employee
    Frontend->>API: PUT /api/employes/{id}
    API->>Service: updateEmploye(id, employeDto)
    Service->>DB: UPDATE employee
    DB-->>Service: Return updated employee
    Service-->>API: Return employee data
    API-->>Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend-->>HR: Show success notification

    %% Delete Employee
    HR->>Frontend: Delete employee
    Frontend->>API: DELETE /api/employes/{id}
    API->>Service: deleteEmploye(id)
    Service->>DB: DELETE employee
    DB-->>Service: Confirm deletion
    Service-->>API: Return success
    API-->>Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend-->>HR: Show success notification
```